<title>USA: TABLE - Sabre Group Q2 shr increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Sabre Group Q2 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.45		    $0.38</p>
<p> Oper income	     93,000		   87,000</p>
<p> Net			 58,000		   49,000</p>
<p> Revs		     447,000		  411,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 130,800		  130,600</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.96		    $0.87</p>
<p> Oper income	    201,000		  197,000</p>
<p> Net			125,000		  113,000</p>
<p> Revs		     887,000		  832,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 130,800		  130,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Sabre Group Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>1996 figures are pro forma figures, reflecting the impact of new contracts with American Airlines of AMR Corp, which were entered into July 1, 1996 (made retroactive to January 1, 1996). The figures also reflect impact of certain other transactions resulting from the legal organization of the company in July 1996.</p>
<p>1996 shr pro forma figures are based upon weighted average common shares outstanding, assuming the reorganization and initial pubilic offering were consummated January 1, 1996.</p>
